  1546                              <1> ; measure_clock -> [ST_MHZ]: 250 passes of 32 x DIV BX + LOOP, built at
  1547                              <1> ; 0:7C00 (RAM: the ROM has wait states) and timed by PIT channel 2.
  1548                              <1> ; 80286: DIV r16 22 clocks, LOOP 8 + the queue refill (2 bytes): 714 per
  1549                              <1> ; pass. Shown only within 1/16 of a standard clock.
  1550                              <1> measure_clock:
  1551 00000887 06                  <1>     push es
  1552 00000888 6A00                <1>     push 0
  1553 0000088A 07                  <1>     pop  es
